---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import ModelStudy from '../components/ModelStudy.astro';
import PortalPreview from '../components/PortalPreview.astro';
const capabilities = [
  ['01', 'FULL-HOME REHAB', 'Complete home rehabilitation, from existing-condition review and layout changes to interiors, exteriors and final finishes.'],
  ['02', 'DUPLEX & FOURPLEX REHAB', 'Unit interiors, shared areas and phased scopes for multifamily properties being prepared to rent, hold or sell.'],
  ['03', 'COMMERCIAL PROPERTY REHAB', 'Building and interior improvements aligned with the next occupant, business use or leasing strategy.'],
  ['04', 'FRAMING & BUILDING SYSTEMS', 'Framing, structural changes, electrical, plumbing and HVAC coordinated with the appropriate project professionals.'],
  ['05', 'INTERIORS & EXTERIORS', 'Kitchens, bathrooms, cabinetry, flooring, windows, doors, siding and decks brought into one complete scope.'],
  ['06', 'INSPECTIONS & HANDOVER', 'Required inspection coordination, agreed corrections, punch-list review and organized closeout documentation.'],
];
---
<SiteLayout title="Full-Property Rehab & Renovation | North Alabama" description="Full-home, duplex, fourplex and commercial property rehab in North Alabama. A coordinated scope, inspection planning and private client portal visibility with Apex." dark>
<section class="v2-hero preview-investor-hero">
  <img class="v2-hero-image" src="/assets/home-editorial.webp" alt="Architectural concept of a renovated brick home with black metal roofing and a timber entry" fetchpriority="high"  width="1672" height="941" />
  <div class="v2-hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="preview-concept-label">Design concept</span>
  <div class="wrap v2-hero-content"><div class="v2-hero-kicker"><span class="eyebrow">INVESTOR RENOVATION / RESALE & RENTAL</span><span class="v2-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div>
    <h1>RENOVATE TO SELL.<br /><span>RENOVATE TO RENT.</span></h1>
    <div class="v2-hero-bottom"><div><p>Full-property rehab for investors preparing to sell or rent. One contact for the agreed scope, from property review through handover.</p><div class="apex-hero-actions"><a class="v2-button" href="/start-your-project/">DISCUSS A REHAB <span><Icon /></span></a><a class="v2-text-link" href="/client-experience/">THE CLIENT EXPERIENCE <Icon /></a></div></div><div class="v2-hero-detail"><span>THE APEX STANDARD</span><p>A clear scope. A coordinated plan.<br />One contact for the work.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="v2-property-rail"><span>FULL-HOME REHAB</span><span>DUPLEXES & FOURPLEXES</span><span>COMMERCIAL</span><span>PROJECT VISIBILITY</span><span>NORTH ALABAMA</span></div>
<section class="apex-portal-feature" aria-labelledby="client-visibility-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="v2-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE APEX CLIENT EXPERIENCE</span><h2 id="client-visibility-title">YOUR PROJECT.<br /><span>IN FULL VIEW.</span></h2></div><div><p>Property rehab involves significant decisions. Your private client portal keeps the recorded scope, work plan, photographs, payment records and documents in one place.</p><a class="v2-text-link" href="/client-experience/">EXPLORE THE CLIENT EXPERIENCE <Icon /></a></div></div><PortalPreview id="home-workspace" /></div></section>
<section class="v2-section v2-intro wrap" id="capabilities"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / FULL-PROPERTY REHABILITATION</span><h2>BEYOND THE SURFACE.<br /><span class="v2-muted">DOWN TO THE<br />STRUCTURE.</span></h2></div><div class="v2-intro-copy"><p class="v2-lead">An acquired property deserves a plan for everything it can become.</p><p>Apex Property Renovation coordinates full-property rehab for investors. The intended use—resale or rental—guides the agreed scope, finish level and sequence.</p><p>One contact to coordinate the agreed scope, trades, project decisions and handover. Start with the property’s condition and what you plan to do with it.</p><a class="v2-text-link" href="/renovations/">EXPLORE OUR CAPABILITIES <Icon /></a></div></section>
<section class="preview-referral" id="referrals" aria-labelledby="referral-title"><div class="wrap preview-referral-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">FOR BROKERS &amp; BUYER’S AGENTS</span><h2 id="referral-title">WHEN THE REHAB<br /><span>HOLDS UP THE SALE.</span></h2></div><div><p>If your buyer likes the property but the work is holding them back, introduce us. We can discuss the rehab with them and help you move the sale forward. <a href="/broker-referrals/">See how broker referrals work.</a></p><a class="v2-button" href="/start-your-project/">MAKE AN INTRODUCTION <span><Icon /></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="v2-work wrap" id="selected-work"><div class="v2-work-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THE WORK / THE DETAIL</span><span class="eyebrow">SELECTED PROJECT</span></div><div class="v2-work-grid"><figure><img src="/assets/apex-wine-room.jpeg" alt="Completed wine room with custom timber storage, wall-mounted wine racks and herringbone tile" width="1290" height="949" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>COMPLETED PROJECT / WINE ROOM <span>Original project photograph</span></figcaption></figure><div class="v2-work-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE FINISH IS NEVER AN AFTERTHOUGHT.</span><h2>DETAILS<br />THAT HOLD<br /><span>THE ROOM.</span></h2><p>Natural wood. Herringbone tile. Wall-to-wall wine storage. A room with a purpose—and a finish with presence.</p><p>A completed wine-room renovation. Thoughtful material choices, precise storage and a cohesive finish.</p><a class="v2-text-link" href="/start-your-project/">BRING YOUR PROJECT TO APEX <Icon /></a></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap v3-photo-section" aria-labelledby="photo-heading"><div class="v3-photo-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONE PROPERTY. EVERY POSSIBILITY.</span><h2 id="photo-heading">INSIDE. OUTSIDE.<br /><span class="v2-muted">THE WHOLE PICTURE.</span></h2></div><p>Residential and commercial properties. Interiors, exteriors and the systems behind them. One complete rehab scope.</p></div><div class="v5-capability-links">{[
  {title:'FULL-HOME REHAB',href:'/renovations/whole-home/'},
  {title:'DUPLEX & FOURPLEX REHAB',href:'/renovations/investment-properties/'},
  {title:'COMMERCIAL PROPERTY REHAB',href:'/renovations/commercial/'},
  {title:'KITCHENS, INTERIORS & FINISHES',href:'/renovations/kitchens-bathrooms/'}
].map(item=><a href={item.href}>{item.title}<Icon /></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="v2-section v2-lab"><div class="wrap"><div class="v2-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 / A DIFFERENT WAY TO SEE IT</span><h2>FROM SHELL<br /><span class="v2-muted">TO STANDOUT.</span></h2></div><p>Explore a clearer layout. Consider the finishes.<br />Then step inside our 3D property concepts.</p></div><ModelStudy /></div></section>
<section class="v2-section v2-investor"><div class="wrap v2-investor-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / OWNERS, INVESTORS & PORTFOLIOS</span><h2>YOUR PROPERTY.<br />YOUR STRATEGY.<br /><span>ONE CLEAR SCOPE.</span></h2><p>A long-term hold, a planned resale or a building for your own use. The rehab should serve the strategy, with a finish level and sequence defined around the property.</p><a href="/renovations/investment-properties/" class="v2-button">PLAN YOUR INVESTMENT PROJECT <span><Icon /></span></a></div><div class="v2-investor-rows"><article><span>01 / RENTAL & LONG-TERM HOLD</span><h3>PREPARE FOR THE NEXT OCCUPANT.</h3><p>Prioritize durable finishes, practical layouts and the agreed work needed to prepare the property for leasing.</p></article><article><span>02 / REHAB FOR RESALE</span><h3>REBUILD WITH THE EXIT IN MIND.</h3><p>Set a coherent finish level and define the improvements needed to prepare the property for its next owner.</p></article><article><span>03 / OWNER & BUSINESS OCCUPANCY</span><h3>BUILD AROUND THE NEXT USE.</h3><p>Coordinate the spaces, systems and final details for a private residence or a commercial property you intend to occupy.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="v2-section wrap"><div class="v2-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">05 / FROM CONDITION REVIEW TO CLOSEOUT</span><h2>FROM THE FRAME<br /><span class="v2-muted">TO THE FINAL DETAIL.</span></h2></div><a class="v2-text-link" href="/renovations/">THE FULL CAPABILITY <Icon /></a></div><div class="v2-scope-grid">{capabilities.map(([n,h,p])=><article><span>{n}</span><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div><div class="v2-future"><strong>GROUND-UP HOMES / A FUTURE CHAPTER</strong><p>New-home construction is planned for after the required Alabama licensing is in place. Current inquiries focus on property rehab and renovation.</p></div></section>
<section class="v2-process-section"><div class="wrap v2-process-grid v5-process-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">06 / A DEFINED PATH TO HANDOVER</span><h2>THE PLAN.<br />THE PEOPLE.<br /><span>THE PROGRESS.</span></h2></div><div><ol><li><b>DEFINE THE REHAB.</b><p>Review the property’s condition, intended use, budget and required scope.</p></li><li><b>COORDINATE & DOCUMENT.</b><p>Bring the project team and trades into sequence. Follow recorded work, decisions and documents through your client portal.</p></li><li><b>COMPLETE THE HANDOVER.</b><p>Coordinate required inspections, review the punch list and assemble the closeout record for the agreed work.</p></li></ol><a href="/experience/" class="v2-text-link">HOW APEX WORKS <Icon /></a></div></div></section>
<CTA />
</SiteLayout>
